pluk: [@x~]: empty pattern
pluk: [@x/~]: empty pattern
pluk: [@x~^]: empty pattern
pluk: [@x~a(]: regex parse error:
    a(
     ^
error: unclosed group
pluk: [@x~(.)\1]: regex parse error:
    (.)\1
       ^^
error: backreferences are not supported
pluk: [@x~a(?=b)]: regex parse error:
    a(?=b)
     ^^^
error: look-around, including look-ahead and look-behind, is not supported
pluk: [@x~a/b]: extra argument [/b] not allowed with ~ (write '/' or '~' in VALUE as %2F or %7E)
pluk: [@x=a~b]: extra argument [~b] not allowed with = (write '/' or '~' in VALUE as %2F or %7E)
pluk: [@x=3/4]: extra argument [/4] not allowed with = (write '/' or '~' in VALUE as %2F or %7E)
